{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02395",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 5.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Uh, hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.66,
      "end_seconds": 10.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.82,
      "end_seconds": 21.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "it's severe pain in the lower leg after a fracture i thought I'd wait you know but it hasn't gone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.95,
      "end_seconds": 25.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "how often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.68,
      "end_seconds": 29.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "I'd say every other day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.31,
      "end_seconds": 34.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.59,
      "end_seconds": 48.03,
      "duration_seconds": 11.44,
      "text": "Mm it usually comes with tingling in the foot. The tingling in the foot? That's been for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.72,
      "end_seconds": 53.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.57,
      "end_seconds": 66.95,
      "duration_seconds": 12.38,
      "text": "Actually, maybe a four out of ten on a bad day. I've, I've also had pain out of proportion, for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.83,
      "end_seconds": 72.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.95,
      "end_seconds": 81.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I'm on iron tablets once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.29,
      "end_seconds": 86.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.66,
      "end_seconds": 93.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "About about a year. It's strong painkillers not working."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.77,
      "end_seconds": 98.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "right have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.9,
      "end_seconds": 103.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "erm just my septum straightened in my thirties"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.37,
      "end_seconds": 125.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "right tell me about your routine work habits that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.81,
      "end_seconds": 143.84,
      "duration_seconds": 18.03,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. Nothing, I'm teetotal. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.63,
      "end_seconds": 150.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.38,
      "end_seconds": 156.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "so so I've had low haemoglobin for nearly five years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.11,
      "end_seconds": 162.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "sure and and what about chest pain, wound infection or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.16,
      "end_seconds": 167.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "right, none of those, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.77,
      "end_seconds": 170.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.81,
      "end_seconds": 175.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "well, no, that's all fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.92,
      "end_seconds": 179.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.62,
      "end_seconds": 187.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "sorry, you know, what was I saying, no, my breathing's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.3,
      "end_seconds": 203.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.94,
      "end_seconds": 214.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.72,
      "end_seconds": 240.76,
      "duration_seconds": 13.04,
      "text": "Okay: height 173 centimetres, BP is 125 over 72, respiratory rate 16. And pulse 80, weight 91 kilos, temperature is 36.9 degrees, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.63,
      "end_seconds": 245.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Is that that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.64,
      "end_seconds": 248.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "we'll go over that shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.13,
      "end_seconds": 255.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now if that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.94,
      "end_seconds": 258.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.8,
      "end_seconds": 279.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "The calf is tense and shiny, and stretching the toes makes the pain much worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.14,
      "end_seconds": 294.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.59,
      "text": "that's the examination finished so based on the history and the examination I think we're dealing with possible compartment syndrome needing urgent surgery at this stage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.6,
      "end_seconds": 332.39,
      "duration_seconds": 19.79,
      "text": "Let's book measuring the pressure in the leg to look into possible compartment syndrome. Remove the cast now, you are going to theatre for a decompression. See me again straight away. What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.94,
      "end_seconds": 337.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "So I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.72,
      "end_seconds": 342.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.69,
      "end_seconds": 347.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "oh, great, thank you for your help"
    }
  ]
}